<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tegal raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tegal raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens &amp; Co analyst Dan Klesken raised his recommendation on Tegal Corp to buy from long-term attractive based on strong booking and strong revenues and earnings.</p>
<p>-- raised his earnings estimate for fiscal 1997 to $0.29 from $0.25 a share and his 1998 estimate to $0.30 from $0.25 a share.</p>
<p>Tegal shares were 1-1/4 higher at 8-3/4 in afternoon trading on Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
